{
 "_comment": [
  "RadIDE.Controls (radide/runtimes/dotnet/RadIDE.Controls, MIT): the RAD Modern controls (Rm*) for the native .NET",
  "build (dotnet_winforms.py). Same names / props / events as docs/plans/MODERN_CONTROLS.md and the radforms C modules.",
  "props: \"FormProp\": \"NetProp[:enum:Type|:color|:image|:date|:json|:float]\" (.NET names that clash with WinForms",
  "members are renamed: Columns -> ColumnsJson ...; the library answers the neutral names too, see RmNameAttribute).",
  "pageProp: the child property that picks the page of a container with pages (GetPage(i).Controls.Add).",
  "references: standalone / framework builds add a ProjectReference (merged into the single-file exe, only the needed",
  "framework is restored via targetsProperty); netfx compiles the sources with csc into a cached net48 dll that is",
  "embedded into the exe (one file). formInit runs at the end of InitializeComponent of a form that uses the library."
 ],
